Both 0result.sql and 1result.sql correctly  
• restrict the data to 2017,  
• keep only the two rider categories that matter,  
• convert seconds → minutes → thousands‑of‑minutes, and  
• return the month with the greatest absolute gap (July = 7).

However, 1result.sql does the entire calculation in a single CTE and a single final SELECT, making it the most concise, readable—and therefore preferable—solution.

```plaintext
1result.sql
